## STM32 Pin Configuration

| STM32 Pin | Peripheral / Function | Connected Device |
|---|---|---|
| PA0 | ADC1_IN1 | ACS712 output |
| PA2 | USART2_TX | UART |
| PA3 | USART2_RX | UART |
| PA5 | GPIO | Nucleo LED |
| PC0 | TIM1_CH1 | L298N ENA / PWM |
| PC1 | GPIO Output | L298N IN1 |
| PC2 | GPIO Output | L298N IN2 |
| PA15 | I2C1_SCL | MPU-6500 SCL |
| PB7 | I2C1_SDA | MPU-6500 SDA |
| PB0 | GPIO | DHT11 DATA |
